<h2>The procedural history</h2>
<div class="flow">
<div class="fstep"><strong>February 2019</strong> — In OMP(I)(COMM) 7/2019 under Section 9 of the 1996 Act, the respondent obtains an interim order dated 12 February 2019 restraining the petitioner, relying on two letters dated 18 December 2018 and 15 January 2019.</div>
